1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Remember this, as you gained fame, as you gained fortune, as you gained position and

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,000
seniority, people will treat you better.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
They will hold doors open for you.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,000
They will get you a cup of tea and coffee without you even asking.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,000
They will call you Sir and Ma'am, and they will give you stuff.

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
None of that stuff is meant for you.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
That stuff is meant for the position you hold.

8
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,000
It is meant for the level that you have achieved of leader, or success, or whatever you want

9
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:33,000
to call it, but you will always deserve a styrofoam cup.

10
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Remember that.

11
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Remember that lesson of humility and gratitude.

12
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:38,000
You can accept all the free stuff.

13
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,000
You can accept all the perks.

14
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Absolutely you can enjoy them but just be grateful for them and know that they are not

15
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:46,000
for you.

